---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title="About" description="Who writes the Scolah engineering blog." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="wrap">
			<article>
				<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
				<h1>We build Scolah.</h1>
				<p>
					Scolah makes software for the people who look after children and families: the free Scolah
					app that connects families with their school, and the Scolah Compass suite that social
					protection programmes use to register households, manage cases, pay benefits and account for
					every budget line and box of stock.
				</p>
				<p>
					Our products run in our cloud and on servers our customers own, in places where the network
					is the exception rather than the rule. Most of the interesting engineering comes from that
					combination.
				</p>
				<p>
					This blog is where the team writes about how we build and run it. Want to know more about the
					products? Visit <a href="https://scolah.com">scolah.com</a> or read the
					<a href="https://docs.scolah.com">documentation</a>.
				</p>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	article {
		max-width: 720px;
		padding: 5rem 0 0;
	}
	h1 {
		margin: 0.8rem 0 1.5rem;
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		article {
			padding-top: 3rem;
		}
	}
</style>
